      "28": {
        "content": "### Delegation / A2A hops\nNo cross-agent delegation hop was emitted in the captured single-agent runs (consistent with ISI-1403 \u2014 local qwen3.6 rarely emits `delegate_to_persona`). **When delegation happens** it appears as an `execute_tool` span for the transfer tool + a client `POST` to the child agent\u2019s A2A task endpoint + the child\u2019s own `invoke_agent <child>` subtree on a linked trace. Build delegation panels on `invoke_agent` spans grouped by `gen_ai.agent.name` + trace linkage \u2014 there is no dedicated delegation metric. _ISI-1571 / ISI-1570 \u00a72.6._",
        "type": "markdown"
      },
      "29": {
        "davis": {
          "davisVisualization": {
            "isAvailable": true
          },
          "enabled": false
        },
        "query": "fetch logs\n| filter k8s.cluster.name == \"observable-crewai\" and gen_ai.system == \"crewai\"\n| sort timestamp desc\n| fields timestamp, agent = `service.name`, content, trace_id, span_id\n| limit 200",
        "querySettings": {
          "defaultSamplingRatio": 10,
          "defaultScanLimitGbytes": 500,
          "enableSampling": false,
          "maxResultMegaBytes": 100,
          "maxResultRecords": 1000
        },
        "title": "GenAI Event Logs (trace-correlated)",
        "type": "data",
        "visualization": "table",
        "visualizationSettings": {
          "autoSelectVisualization": false
        }
      },
